  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n860% of 50\n\n50% of 860\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nPercentage of a number = (Percentage × Number) / 100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n860% of 50 = (860 × 50) / 100\n\n⇒ 860% of 50 = 43000 / 100\n\n⇒ 860% of 50 = 430\n\n50% of 860 = (50 × 860) / 100\n\n⇒ 50% of 860 = 43000 / 100\n\n⇒ 50% of 860 = 430\n\n860% of 50 ÷ 50% of 860 = 430 ÷ 430\n\n⇒ 860% of 50 ÷ 50% of 860 = 1\n\n**The correct answer is option 1.**",
